OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fmainly dry and rather cloudy with the
OL,7,Fbest of any cloud breaks towards
OL,8,FStirling. A little patchy drizzle
OL,9,Fpossible over the hills with winds
OL,10,Fcoming in off the North Sea.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FIt will be mostly cloudy but
OL,13,Fgenerally dry, best of any brightness
OL,14,Fin the west. A few showery outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain possible, mainly over the
OL,16,Fhills. Moderate easterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
