OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain or
OL,6,Fshowers on Friday, perhaps heavy and
OL,7,Fthundery. Further rain or showers over
OL,8,Fthe weekend with some drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter spells.
